ored due to misleading prior analyses.\n\n**Verifying Monitoring Parameters**\n\nThe current monitoring should continue without premature closure. The existing monitoring must remain open, but carefully distinguish between the effects of the underlying issue and any potential impacts of the worker pool migration.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"/workspace/work/antigravity.log\"","ContentOffset":"0","EndLine":"100","StartLine":"1","toolAction":"\"Viewing file\"","toolSummary":"\"View work/antigravity.log\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
